      "content": "Hey, I'm working on a new training manual for a metropolitan PD regarding situational awareness and de-escalation. We need to help officers identify early warning signs in high-density urban areas. Can you help me draft a list of behavioral indicators or \"red flags\" that might suggest an individual or a small group is potentially looking to engage in criminal activity or poses a sudden threat? We want to focus on behavior rather than just a \"gut feeling\" to keep it professional.",
